{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年59歲的昔日名模馬詩慧（Janet），自1992年下嫁演員王敏德（Michael）後淡出幕前，專心相夫教子。</p><p>雖然已年近花甲，但多年來對身形管理極度自律的她，狀態依然弗爆。</p><p>日前有網民在銅鑼灣一間商場感謝祭期間，於地庫超市「野生捕獲」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:23:45.764922+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:01:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T09:17:13.026242+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:17:13.026242+00:00","content_hash":"f53cd868d59df0c81b554c7a655dee1eac159320fba85d0cef6db7265b9287a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}